# Smart-routing hints

When the user's request matches a known scenario, suggest or invoke the documented chain. Full matrix: `platform/architecture/smart-routing-matrix.md` (create in spoke if missing).

| User intent | Chain |
|-------------|-------|
| Plan first / confirm before work | skill `plan-gate` (`/plan-gate`) |
| New project / init repo | skill `project-init-pipeline` (`/project-init-pipeline`) |
| Check doc vs spec/normative | skill `compliance-check-pipeline` or `@doc-consistency-guard` |
| Terminology check | `@terminology-consistency-guard` |
| Search / analytical report | skill `context-search-report` or `@context-search-analyst` |
| Meeting in mymeet.ai → process | skill `mymeet-meeting-pipeline` (`/mymeet-meeting-pipeline`) |
| Import meeting from mymeet only | skill `mymeet-meeting-import` |
| Transcript already on disk → Excel | skill `meeting-transcript-pipeline` |
| Meeting → requirements diff | skill `requirements-from-meeting` |
| Implement from spec | skill `spec-to-code-pipeline` |
| Update file registry / file-list | `@structure-indexer` |
| Code review before merge | `@code-reviewer` |
| Where to put a new document | `platform/samples/document-lifecycle/STRUCTURE-AND-DOCUMENT-WORKFLOW.md` |

Always confirm **human approver** role from the routing matrix before treating output as final.
